  "retrieval_method": "Anonymous GitLab REST API archive endpoint GET /api/v4/projects/115837/repository/archive.tar.gz?sha=<commit> (HTTP 200, 24,759,965 bytes), extracted at the pinned commit. Edges live in three subfolders classic/reductions/, approximation/reductions/, parameterized/reductions/ (one .md file per reduction), NOT a single top-level reductions/ folder.",
  "paper": "arXiv:2511.04308",
  "reachable": true
